  "how_the_page_was_identified": "T-1138's own identification, unchanged and re-used: the PDF holds nine issues of four leaves each and the masthead of every fourth leaf carries the date and the volume line, so leaf 0000 is 1 April No. 18, leaf 0004 is 8 April No. 19 and leaf 0008 is 16 April No. 20. This return therefore stands on leaves 0002, 0006 and 0011. A SECOND office's list -- Hennepin's, signed THOS. GALAHER, Jr. P. M. -- stands on leaf 0010 and is not this one."
