   "Mrs. Robt. Hountton"
  ],
  "why_no_firms": "The 1 January return prints two firms and one line naming two people; this return prints neither. Every one of its 193 lines is one addressee, so the printed length and the count of people named are the same number here -- which is the opposite of January's case and is stated so that the difference is not read as an oversight."
 },
